  "body": "## Change and mathematical scope\n\nThis package records a **scoped negative result** for the zero-storage early-fanout timing move. It injects one selected centre output through its pinned 22-row canonical scatter before the selected forward scalar program, suppresses that centre output at its selected event, and compares the complete 704-local-role endpoint over all eight basis outputs in Q^8.\n\nThe exact Q-linear common-frame projection retains all 19,693 scalar events of the pinned forward program. The number of differing local roles is 34, 34, 36, 36, 54, 54, 56, and 56. For centre channel 0, normal minus early is exactly 1/4 at role L114. The result rejects only this early/no-storage timing move in that scalar projection. It does not rule out native frame transport, persistent storage, phase reordering, other schedules, or a changed interface. It supplies no supplier, new kappa, or full-call endpoint result.\n\nThe favorable screen in the pinned actual-profile overhead note gives 32 units/call of ideal centre saving and at most a 3.4536% whole-bound gain; this experiment assumes zero added carry/copy/restoration/frame/precision/hosting cost. The required scalar endpoint identity already fails, so no surviving schedule or full cost invoice is claimed.\n\n## Task and overlap\n\n- Task: `centre-path-sharing`, track `recursive-interfaces`, refined scope, seed `2803b7f39d0d886af6d0a63cd1521a40`, scope key `a55534776f5479f1686c`.\n- Assignment base: `e112d71c8d7bb32435debcc54df932593dd8223a`, catalogue revision 3, catalogue SHA256 `6686ad58f1fbdbc87134a78901b60fd53a20d3984355e91defbbebc9e9fa8075`.\n- Selected record SHA256: `10b9e340fd8e354a37a0c4813c90e5de1dd42044b5f6aca4a3fc5a42b685fa32`.\n- Current main advanced to `7c1e7811c730b17fe0eeef6c82ef011318b0465e` (priority revision 4) during this cycle; it retains `centre-path-sharing`. The package preserves the exact revision-3 assignment and source pins.\n- Added value: PRs #1708/#1748/#1791/#1829/#1838 concern aligned centre sharing, return/precision, actual-profile overhead, adjacent owner census, and a rank-one centre-difference mechanism. Discussion #1963 is a scoped helper-carried aliasing negative. PR #2048 treats the fixed time0/time1 replica0/8 source minor. PR #2052 bounds simultaneous multi-pair stage schedules. This package tests a distinct temporal commutation condition across the pinned scalar prefix. Exact predecessor heads and the refreshed overlap receipt are in `research/centre-prefix-fanout-obstruction-seed2803b7/OVERLAP.json`.\n\n## Validation\n\nFrom the repository root:\n\n```sh\npython3 -B research/centre-prefix-fanout-obstruction-seed2803b7/verify.py\npython3 scripts/research_package.py --package research/centre-prefix-fanout-obstruction-seed2803b7 --check-only\n```\n\nObserved direct marker:\n\n```text\nPASS_CENTRE_PREFIX_FANOUT_OBSTRUCTION channels=8 mismatched=8 counts=34,34,36,36,54,54,56,56 center0_role114=1/4 controls=3 no_new_kappa\n```\n\nThe verifier checks selected-record, archive and archive-member hashes; complete forward/backward program digests; all eight centre events and 176 canonical scatter coefficients; exact Fraction arithmetic; a commuting identity-prefix control; a noncommuting read-before-centre control; and rejection of a mutated cut. Local direct replay used CPython 3.14.7. `--check-only` passed. A Python 3.12 interpreter is unavailable locally, so the registered Python 3.12 replay was not run here; hosted workflow status is separate. This is not the full selected native-frame replay or a supplier acceptance check.\n\n## Credit\n\nPrepared by Cinna Davis with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance in scope selection, derivation, implementation, replay and writing. No independent human review or proof-assistant formalization is claimed. Source/predecessor attribution is retained, and new work is Apache-2.0.\n\n## Open next questions\n\nCan one exact full-call phase reordering or persistent centre bank preserve every dirty helper endpoint and keep its fully charged cost below the 32-per-call ideal saving? First specify a call pair, saved components, owner windows and complete copy/restoration/frame/precision/hosting invoice; no such priced carry-state contract is known.\n",
